DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261213
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261214
SUMMARY:Creatine Price Presents The Drag Messiah
LOCATION:National Sawdust\, 80 N 6th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:Lauded by the Huffington Post as "innovative" and "genre-defyin
 g" Hallelujah\, gurl\, the Drag Messiah 2026 is here! Creatine Price bring
 s The Drag Messiah to National Sawdust for two nights of Handel’s Messia
 h like you’ve never seen before. The viral sensation is back and bigger 
 than ever. Drag numbers\, baroque opulence and glorious irreverence are wh
 at this holiday tradition are all about. In this queer reimagining of Hand
 el’s Messiah\, the grandeur of the music meets the wit and theatricality
  of drag. Joined by an ensemble of singers and instrumentalists\, the oper
 atic tenor and Drag Race France queen invites audiences into a celebration
  of community\, self-expression\, and the joy of making a beloved traditio
 n your own.\nhttps://www.nationalsawdust.org/event/creatine-price-presents
 -the-drag-messiah-12-13-26\nFrom Pushpin NYC: https://pushpin.city/nyc/
URL:https://www.nationalsawdust.org/event/creatine-price-presents-the-drag-
 messiah-12-13-26
END:VEVENT
